<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Demand moderate to light. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 58.00-59.00, few 59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 57.00-58.00</p>
<p>Sows: Mostly steady. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 44.00-47.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-49.00, few 50.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 48.00-50.00, few 51.00</p>
</text>
